OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FShowers
OL,6,Fbecoming lighter, fewer and further
OL,7,Fbetween overnight, mainly affecting
OL,8,Fwestern areas. Drier with clear spells
OL,9,Fwidely, allowing a colder night than
